{"strongs": "H7970", "word": "שְׁלשִׁים", "translit": "she.lo.shim", "root": "שלש", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun indeclinable", "gloss": "thirty", "definition": "שְׁלשִׁים (very seldom שְׁלשִׁפ , שְׁלוֺשִׁים ):174 noun indeclinable thirty ; — 1. before singular noun: אַמָּה Gen 6:15 + 3 t., +, with בָּאַמָּה Exod 26:8 +3 t.; שָׁנָה 2Sam 5:4 + 12 t. (age of paternity, of Levitical or royal duty, etc.), אִישׁ Judg 14:19 + 3 t., etc.; before plural noun בָּנִים Judg 10:4 ; Judg 12:9 , אֲנְשִׁים Jer 38:10 (read here probably שְׁלשָׁהּ Ew Hi Gf and others), less common words Ezek 40:17 ; Ezra 1:9 ; Ezra 1:10 , etc.; after plural noun Gen 32:16 , פְּעָמִים ׳ שׁ Ezek 41:6 אֶלֶף ׳ שׁ 1Chr 23:3 +, אֲלָפִים ׳ שׁ Ezra 2:35 ; Neh 7:38 ׳ שׁ following units Gen 11:12 + 14 t., precedes 1Kgs 22:42 + 29 t.; ׳ שׁ following 100 (1000, etc.) Gen 5:5 + 15 t., precedes Gen 5:3 + 21 t. 2. as ordinal ׳ וְאַחַת שָׁנְה לְ שָׁנָה לְ (בִּ) שְׁנַת שׁ 1Kgs 16:23 , compare v 1Kgs 16:29 + 4 t.; שָׁנְה omitted Neh 5:14 + 4 t.; שְׁנַת omitted 2Kgs 25:27 = Jer 52:31 שָׁנָךְ ׳ בִּשׁ alone Ezek 1:1 . — 1Sam 13:5 read שְׁלשֶׁת ᵐ5 L We Dr and others; 2Sam 23:13 read שְׁלשָׁה Qr Vrss Th and modern; 1Chr 11:11 read הַשְּׁלשֶׁת , הַשְּׁלשָׁה ᵐ5 L Kit Benz and others (so || 2Sam 23:8 for הַשָּׁלִשִׁי ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8766')\">BDB8766</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7970')\">H7970</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8765')\">BDB8765</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8767')\">BDB8767</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שְׁלשִׁים</bdbheb> (very seldom <bdbheb>שְׁלשִׁפ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>שְׁלוֺשִׁים</bdbheb>):174 <b>noun indeclinable</b> <highlightword>thirty</highlightword>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> before singular noun: <bdbheb>אַמָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 6:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,6,15)\">Gen 6:15</ref> + 3 t., +, with <bdbheb>בָּאַמָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 26:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,26,8)\">Exod 26:8</ref> +3 t.; <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 5:4\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(10,5,4)\">2Sam 5:4</ref> + 12 t. (age of paternity, of Levitical or royal duty, etc.), <bdbheb>אִישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 14:19\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(7,14,19)\">Judg 14:19</ref> + 3 t., etc.; before plural noun <bdbheb>בָּנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 10:4\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(7,10,4)\">Judg 10:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 12:9\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(7,12,9)\">Judg 12:9</ref>, <bdbheb>אֲנְשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 38:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,38,10)\">Jer 38:10</ref> (read here probably <bdbheb>שְׁלשָׁהּ</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gf')\">Gf</lookup> and others), less common words <ref ref=\"Ezek 40:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,40,17)\">Ezek 40:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 1:9\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(15,1,9)\">Ezra 1:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 1:10\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(15,1,10)\">Ezra 1:10</ref>, etc.; after plural noun <ref ref=\"Gen 32:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,16)\">Gen 32:16</ref>, <bdbheb>פְּעָמִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 41:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,6)\">Ezek 41:6</ref> <bdbheb>אֶלֶף</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:3\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,3)\">1Chr 23:3</ref> +, <bdbheb>אֲלָפִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:35\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,35)\">Ezra 2:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 7:38\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,38)\">Neh 7:38</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> following units <ref ref=\"Gen 11:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,12)\">Gen 11:12</ref> + 14 t., precedes <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:42\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,42)\">1Kgs 22:42</ref> + 29 t.; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> following 100 (1000, etc.) <ref ref=\"Gen 5:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,5)\">Gen 5:5</ref> + 15 t., precedes <ref ref=\"Gen 5:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,3)\">Gen 5:3</ref> + 21 t. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> as ordinal <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְאַחַת שָׁנְה לְ שָׁנָה לְ (בִּ) שְׁנַת שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:23\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,23)\">1Kgs 16:23</ref>, compare v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:29\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,29)\">1Kgs 16:29</ref> + 4 t.; <bdbheb>שָׁנְה</bdbheb> omitted <ref ref=\"Neh 5:14\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(16,5,14)\">Neh 5:14</ref> + 4 t.; <bdbheb>שְׁנַת</bdbheb> omitted <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:27\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,27)\">2Kgs 25:27</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 52:31\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,31)\">Jer 52:31</ref> <bdbheb>שָׁנָךְ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בִּשׁ</bdbheb> alone <ref ref=\"Ezek 1:1\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(26,1,1)\">Ezek 1:1</ref>. — <ref ref=\"1Sam 13:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,13,5)\">1Sam 13:5</ref> read <bdbheb>שְׁלשֶׁת</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>L</sup></reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> and others; <ref ref=\"2Sam 23:13\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(10,23,13)\">2Sam 23:13</ref> read <bdbheb>שְׁלשָׁה</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vrss')\"><reflink>Vrss</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('The')\">Th</lookup> and modern; <ref ref=\"1Chr 11:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,11,11)\">1Chr 11:11</ref> read <bdbheb>הַשְּׁלשֶׁת</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>הַשְּׁלשָׁה</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>L</sup></reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kit')\">Kit</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Benz')\">Benz</lookup> and others (so || <ref ref=\"2Sam 23:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,23,8)\">2Sam 23:8</ref> for <bdbheb>הַשָּׁלִשִׁי</bdbheb>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 6:15", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 6, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Exod 26:8", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 26, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "2Sam 5:4", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 5, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Judg 14:19", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 14, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Judg 10:4", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 10, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Judg 12:9", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 12, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Jer 38:10", "book": "JER", "chapter": 38, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ezek 40:17", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 40, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Ezra 1:9", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 1, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ezra 1:10", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 1, "verse": 10}, {"raw